WEBVTT

00:02.420 --> 00:04.220
Can you believe that?

00:04.220 --> 00:05.170
No way!

00:07.640 --> 00:08.610
Morning!

00:10.390 --> 00:12.160
Lovely day, huh?

00:13.440 --> 00:14.940
Good morning.

00:14.940 --> 00:16.300
And yes, it is.

00:16.300 --> 00:17.620
Hmm...

00:17.620 --> 00:21.030
Why do you sound so distant, Maki-kun?

00:21.030 --> 00:23.430
I, uh... dunno.

00:23.430 --> 00:25.460
S-Say, Yuu-chin...

00:25.460 --> 00:29.050
I feel like I should ask. 
By "Maki-kun," you don't mean...

00:29.050 --> 00:32.030
Huh? Come on, Ninacchi.

00:32.030 --> 00:34.470
I mean Maehara-kun, obviously.

00:34.860 --> 00:39.210
Maehara Maki-kun. 
You still haven't memorized his name?

00:39.210 --> 00:41.290
O-Of course I have.

00:41.290 --> 00:44.940
We hashed it out 
and became friends, right?

00:45.700 --> 00:46.810
Right.

00:46.810 --> 00:48.730
You can't be serious.

00:48.730 --> 00:50.820
He and Amami-san are friends?

00:50.820 --> 00:54.060
What if he's blackmailing her?

00:54.060 --> 00:55.660
With what dirt?

00:55.660 --> 00:58.330
Don't ask me. I can't think of anything.

00:56.430 --> 00:58.990
Welp, this is all weird now.

00:58.990 --> 01:00.000
Wait...

01:00.000 --> 01:02.850
What happened after you got away 
from me yesterday?

01:02.850 --> 01:04.670
Well...

01:04.670 --> 01:05.680
That's a secret!

01:05.680 --> 01:08.010
That just makes me wanna know even more!

01:06.920 --> 01:10.090
SEE YOU ON FRIDAY

01:06.920 --> 01:10.090
YEAH, THANKS

(TODAY)

SORRY ABOUT YUU

01:08.010 --> 01:09.580
Sorry about Yuu.

01:09.580 --> 01:11.470
Come on, tell me.

01:10.090 --> 01:12.190
Even if I did, you'd just forget.

01:12.190 --> 01:13.820
I would not!

02:46.350 --> 02:48.400
Wow, it's true!

02:48.870 --> 02:51.780
I can't believe nobody's here!

02:51.780 --> 02:57.070
Good sunlight, and there's even seating. 
This is a sweet little spot.

02:57.070 --> 02:59.160
I'm glad you like it.

03:02.950 --> 03:07.790
I never expected to be eating lunch 
with these two.

03:08.550 --> 03:12.340
Maki-kun, wanna eat lunch with me today?

03:12.340 --> 03:13.140
What?

03:13.570 --> 03:15.090
Wait, Yuu!

03:15.400 --> 03:17.560
That sounds like a bad idea.

03:17.560 --> 03:18.770
Is it?

03:18.770 --> 03:22.940
Maki-kun said he didn't like big groups,

03:20.990 --> 03:22.730
The hell?

03:22.730 --> 03:24.720
Talk about beauty and the beast.

03:22.940 --> 03:26.000
so I figured he'd rather 
it was just the two of us.

03:24.720 --> 03:26.310
He must've pulled something underhanded.

03:26.570 --> 03:28.100
Is that so bad?

03:28.100 --> 03:31.460
I mean, it's not bad per se...

03:31.910 --> 03:34.180
But you see the problem, 
right, Maehara-kun?

03:34.180 --> 03:35.830
Y-Yeah...

03:35.830 --> 03:39.330
And I think I'd be too nervous, too.

03:39.330 --> 03:42.330
You heard the guy.

03:42.330 --> 03:44.790
Hm...

03:45.940 --> 03:48.870
Oh, I know! Why don't you join us, Umi?

03:48.870 --> 03:49.920
What?

03:49.920 --> 03:52.840
You were there with us yesterday.

03:53.490 --> 03:55.920
Is that okay, Maki-kun?

03:55.920 --> 03:59.120
Huh? Uh...

04:01.150 --> 04:06.500
Sure. The three of us can 
eat together today.

04:06.500 --> 04:07.690
Really?

04:07.690 --> 04:09.460
Hooray!

04:12.410 --> 04:17.530
It'll attract unwanted attention if I'm 
seen with Asanagi-san and Amami-san,

04:17.910 --> 04:22.140
so I invited them to my 
favorite loner meal spot.

04:22.560 --> 04:23.330
Hey!

04:23.330 --> 04:26.240
Your rolled omelets look yummy, Maki-kun!

04:26.240 --> 04:28.160
Wanna trade for one of my wieners?

04:28.430 --> 04:31.960
Huh? I mean, sure.

04:31.960 --> 04:34.170
But I don't know if you'll like it.

04:34.510 --> 04:37.800
Wait, did you make that lunch yourself?

04:37.800 --> 04:39.260
I do sometimes.

04:39.260 --> 04:41.640
My mom's work keeps her busy.

04:41.640 --> 04:46.600
Oh, no, Yuu! Maki-kun's 
beating us on homemaker skills!

04:46.600 --> 04:49.480
Can you not lump me in with you?

04:51.050 --> 04:52.100
Whoa!

04:52.100 --> 04:54.510
This omelet's delicious!

04:54.510 --> 04:57.300
It's just the right balance of sweet 
and salty to go with white rice.

04:57.300 --> 04:58.180
What?

04:58.630 --> 05:01.240
Can I have one too, Maehara-kun?

05:01.240 --> 05:03.100
Go ahead.

05:10.670 --> 05:11.580
Well?

05:14.160 --> 05:15.620
It's unfairly good.

05:16.990 --> 05:21.380
Wow, you make sweets too, Maki-kun?

05:21.700 --> 05:25.600
What's something you made recently 
that you thought came out well?

05:25.600 --> 05:27.270
Well...

05:27.680 --> 05:32.270
The souffle pancakes I made 
using just bananas and eggs, maybe?

05:34.730 --> 05:49.200
YUU

05:35.880 --> 05:38.750
I dabble in making sweets,

05:38.750 --> 05:43.180
and I'm pretty decent, 
so I thought I could compete...

05:43.180 --> 05:46.310
But nope. I didn't stand a chance.

05:46.310 --> 05:49.200
Don't give up! It's just a flesh wound!

05:49.450 --> 05:51.560
It's not that complicated.

05:51.560 --> 05:55.020
I just watch online tutorials and 
 follow a few simple steps.

05:55.020 --> 06:00.170
Boo, Maki-kun. You make it sound so easy.

06:00.490 --> 06:05.890
Must be nice! Hearing about it 
just makes me wanna try some!

06:06.250 --> 06:09.430
Oh, pancakes...

06:09.430 --> 06:12.890
If you want to try them so badly, 
I can make some for you.

06:12.890 --> 06:14.730
What? Really?!

06:14.730 --> 06:16.940
Hooray!

06:16.940 --> 06:18.890
Pan-pa-pa-pan-pa-pa!

06:18.890 --> 06:21.340
Oh, can I come over today, then?

06:21.340 --> 06:22.070
Uh...

06:23.520 --> 06:24.910
Sure.

06:25.660 --> 06:28.830
Thanks! I'm so excited!

06:29.140 --> 06:31.590
Oh, Umi can come too, right?

06:31.590 --> 06:32.560
Yeah.

06:36.130 --> 06:38.970
Let me go buy some tea!

06:40.120 --> 06:42.040
She's a good girl, isn't she?

06:42.040 --> 06:46.060
Yeah. I knew she was the cheery sort,

06:46.060 --> 06:48.260
but now I'm starting to see she's...

06:49.310 --> 06:50.800
Like a big dog?

06:53.110 --> 06:56.690
Maehara, you're not taking 
any heat because of her, right?

06:58.350 --> 07:03.620
Like, Yuu's not the type to have 
any regard for what people think.

07:04.190 --> 07:07.150
Eh, I was an outcast to begin with.

07:07.150 --> 07:09.990
And it's not like I've been 
harassed or anything.

07:09.990 --> 07:11.950
Let me know if anything like that happens.

07:12.910 --> 07:14.710
I think it'll be fine.

07:15.030 --> 07:17.000
You never know.

07:17.000 --> 07:20.500
After all, we're talking about Amami-san. 
The number-one prettiest in the class.

07:24.070 --> 07:25.290
Hm?

07:25.290 --> 07:27.880
Come on, everyone's saying it, right?

07:28.600 --> 07:31.000
It'd be weirder if I hadn't heard.

07:31.910 --> 07:35.810
Yeah. Nobody knows who first 
started saying it, but it caught on.

07:36.390 --> 07:38.650
The prettiest girl in class, Amami-san,

07:39.020 --> 07:40.790
and the second prettiest...

07:41.910 --> 07:46.030
It's just people talking crap in class. 
It's not worth taking to heart.

07:46.030 --> 07:49.280
I dunno. It feels pretty accurate to me.

07:50.270 --> 07:55.240
Even from a girl's perspective, Yuu's 
always been the prettiest little thing.

07:55.620 --> 07:57.400
She's got the cutest personality, too.

07:57.980 --> 07:58.570
But I think—

07:58.570 --> 07:59.210
So I'm sure...

07:59.870 --> 08:02.110
You'll come to love her in no time, too.

08:04.740 --> 08:06.360
You mean...

08:06.910 --> 08:08.630
I'm back!

08:09.490 --> 08:13.140
...as a friend, right?

08:10.000 --> 08:13.810
The vending machine had a bunch of teas, 
so I bought the most fun-looking one.

08:15.110 --> 08:18.810
Why'd you suddenly take 
an interest in Maehara-kun, anyway?

08:21.940 --> 08:23.520
Because he's nice!

08:23.880 --> 08:29.140
He thinks for himself, and he looks 
you in the eye when speaking.

08:30.590 --> 08:32.980
He's kind of like Umi.

08:35.050 --> 08:36.520
You think?

08:39.510 --> 08:40.460
Here you go.

08:40.740 --> 08:41.920
Wow!

08:41.920 --> 08:44.100
Thanks, Maki-kun!

08:44.720 --> 08:45.800
Okay.

08:45.800 --> 08:47.800
Let's eat!

08:49.410 --> 08:53.140
Whoa, these are so fluffy!

08:53.140 --> 08:55.050
Umi, this is scary good!

08:55.050 --> 08:57.470
Yep, delicious!

08:57.470 --> 08:59.670
You're amazing, Maki-kun.

08:59.670 --> 09:02.810
I could look at a recipe 
all day long and still mess it up.

09:03.160 --> 09:05.320
Because you skip over the details.

09:05.320 --> 09:06.400
Grr.

09:09.630 --> 09:14.160
Like you didn't make a bunch 
of charcoal last Valentine's Day.

09:14.160 --> 09:16.960
Don't call my cookies charcoal!

09:17.830 --> 09:19.120
Valentine's Day?

09:19.440 --> 09:25.100
Oh, it was just a bunch of us girls 
giving each other friendship chocolate.

09:25.100 --> 09:27.090
That was fun, huh?

09:27.780 --> 09:29.060
Oh, right.

09:29.460 --> 09:32.800
They went to an all-girls school 
until the end of middle school.

09:33.540 --> 09:37.720
Tachibana Girls' is considered 
the poshest school around here,

09:37.720 --> 09:41.050
and I believe it's a unified elementary, 
middle, and high school.

09:42.360 --> 09:46.480
So why did they both apply 
to another high school?

09:51.230 --> 09:52.110
Whoa.

09:52.890 --> 09:55.940
Amami-san, is it really 
your first time playing this game?

09:55.940 --> 09:57.240
Sure is.

09:57.520 --> 09:59.600
I kinda figured out how it works.

10:00.550 --> 10:02.800
Over here, Umi-chan.

10:02.800 --> 10:04.410
Catch me if you can!

10:04.410 --> 10:06.130
This girl, I swear!

10:06.530 --> 10:09.630
Um... So I do this and this, and...

10:09.910 --> 10:11.450
Go get her!

10:13.340 --> 10:15.370
What was that attack?!

10:15.370 --> 10:17.070
I found it just now.

10:17.070 --> 10:19.720
I press this and this... and bam!

10:20.240 --> 10:21.730
You got me.

10:22.020 --> 10:24.920
Amami-san, can you 
show me that one more time?

10:24.920 --> 10:26.480
It's like...

10:26.480 --> 10:30.300
You press this and hold this, 
and then take aim...

10:30.300 --> 10:31.080
Right.

10:33.510 --> 10:35.880
Thanks for having us!

10:38.230 --> 10:39.490
Oh, crud!

10:39.490 --> 10:40.610
What?

10:40.610 --> 10:42.360
I forgot to ask.

10:42.760 --> 10:47.180
You see, I wanna treat 
Maki-kun to something, too.

10:47.180 --> 10:49.840
Even if I can't make it myself, 
I can take him someplace nice.

10:49.840 --> 10:53.780
Just so you know, 
I'm not tagging along anymore.

10:53.780 --> 10:55.180
What?!

10:55.880 --> 10:58.470
You two will be just fine without me.

10:59.420 --> 11:03.190
Yuu, you want to get closer 
to Maehara-kun, don't you?

11:03.190 --> 11:04.490
Yeah...

11:07.790 --> 11:09.260
Hello?

11:09.990 --> 11:13.990
Sorry about this. 
Are you free this Friday?

11:15.950 --> 11:18.700
Okay, got it. Thanks.

11:19.110 --> 11:20.300
Bye-bye.

11:21.630 --> 11:22.790
He was free?

11:22.790 --> 11:26.250
Nah. He said he had plans 
with someone already.

11:30.970 --> 11:33.670
Shoot! I forgot my phone!

11:34.390 --> 11:35.870
At Maki-kun's place?

11:35.870 --> 11:37.470
Probably, yeah!

11:46.540 --> 11:48.310
Did you forget something?

11:53.390 --> 11:54.960
See you tomorrow!

11:56.460 --> 11:59.550
Uh... okay?

12:08.790 --> 12:12.420
Oh, remember that manga 
you lent me the other day?

12:12.420 --> 12:14.140
It was pretty good.

12:14.140 --> 12:15.390
Right?

12:15.390 --> 12:19.260
I found the final volume being sold before
street date on the way home. Wanna read?

12:19.260 --> 12:20.390
For real?

12:20.390 --> 12:22.320
You should've said that sooner!

12:23.280 --> 12:25.820
Where is it? In your room?

12:25.820 --> 12:26.940
Gimme!

12:26.940 --> 12:29.050
Okay, but I haven't read it yet.

12:29.050 --> 12:31.230
We can read it together, then.

12:31.230 --> 12:33.070
Let's go to your room.

12:33.070 --> 12:34.620
Hurry up. Hurry up!

12:38.240 --> 12:44.700
LOVING TAKAMINE-KUN

12:41.590 --> 12:43.630
Maehara, you can flip the page.

12:43.630 --> 12:44.320
Okay.

12:48.090 --> 12:52.790
I was worried for a moment there, 
but I'm glad we got a happy ending.

12:52.790 --> 12:56.300
Yep. Nothing beats the classic approach.

12:56.300 --> 12:58.880
I'm gonna re-read it from the beginning.

12:59.420 --> 13:00.680
Where's volume 1?

13:11.470 --> 13:15.480
Phew. It's been a while since 
I binged something like that.

13:16.460 --> 13:19.410
Asanagi, I'm going to make some coffee.

13:23.620 --> 13:25.440
She's asleep.

13:28.280 --> 13:31.020
You're making yourself 
way too comfortable.

13:43.750 --> 13:45.320
Wake up, Maki.

13:46.050 --> 13:47.140
Wake up now.

13:51.450 --> 13:56.790
Sorry, Asanagi. I dozed off, too.

13:56.790 --> 14:01.280
Huh. So this girl's Asanagi-san, is she?

14:03.960 --> 14:07.410
I get off work early for the first time 
in ages, and what do I find?

14:07.940 --> 14:10.400
You'd better have a good 
explanation for this.

14:11.710 --> 14:13.540
Yes, that's right.

14:14.130 --> 14:18.590
They were reading manga 
together and dozed off.

14:18.960 --> 14:23.970
Right. I'm so sorry about my son.

14:19.250 --> 14:22.360
Damn, we really conked out, huh?

14:22.360 --> 14:26.510
Sorry. I was meaning to wake you up 
when it was time to go.

14:27.560 --> 14:29.390
Sorry to keep you waiting, Umi-chan.

14:30.440 --> 14:37.360
It's really late, so your mother has 
agreed to let you stay the night.

14:37.360 --> 14:40.070
What? But...

14:40.070 --> 14:42.160
Go ahead and take a bath first.

14:42.580 --> 14:45.410
I'll leave a pair of my 
pajamas outside the door.

14:45.410 --> 14:46.700
Um...

14:46.700 --> 14:48.220
Er...

14:48.220 --> 14:50.020
Don't be shy, now.

14:52.170 --> 14:53.930
Thank you very much.

15:01.620 --> 15:03.270
Maki.

15:04.920 --> 15:08.660
No wonder I kept coming home 
on Saturday after an all-nighter

15:08.660 --> 15:12.520
to find this place 
smelling of air freshener.

15:12.830 --> 15:15.280
How long have you been 
bringing Umi-chan home?

15:15.280 --> 15:16.850
Phrasing.

15:17.980 --> 15:21.310
We started hanging out here 
two months ago.

15:22.070 --> 15:25.290
But believe me, we're just friends.

15:25.290 --> 15:27.540
We haven't done anything 
you need to worry about.

15:27.540 --> 15:28.620
Listen.

15:28.940 --> 15:32.950
I trust you, 
but Umi-chan's a teenage girl.

15:33.260 --> 15:35.090
You need to be more mindful.

15:35.490 --> 15:37.470
Right. I'm sorry.

15:37.470 --> 15:39.670
I'll go apologize to her family tomorrow.

15:57.270 --> 15:58.480
Hey, uh...

16:01.490 --> 16:05.630
Your mother's pajamas didn't fit me,

16:05.630 --> 16:08.180
so I put on some of your sweats instead.

16:08.180 --> 16:10.870
I don't really mind.

16:15.190 --> 16:17.920
I-I'll sleep in the living room.

16:17.920 --> 16:20.080
Feel free to use the bed.

16:20.080 --> 16:20.990
Hold up.

16:23.200 --> 16:28.100
I just woke up and even took a bath, 
so I'm fully awake now.

16:30.400 --> 16:32.390
Let's chat a little.

16:35.230 --> 16:42.240
You're such a bad boy, making a girl 
as pretty as me spend the night.

16:43.230 --> 16:47.040
It's your fault for sleeping 
like a log to begin with.

16:47.040 --> 16:49.440
Though I'm not blameless, either.

16:50.550 --> 16:51.750
Good point.

16:52.560 --> 16:55.660
For a girl, I left myself too defenseless.

16:56.110 --> 16:57.520
Lesson learned.

16:59.310 --> 17:01.570
We're bad kids, huh?

17:02.250 --> 17:03.100
Yeah.

17:06.910 --> 17:10.280
Hey, I've been wondering for a while...

17:11.500 --> 17:14.510
About telling Yuu about our friendship?

17:14.510 --> 17:17.020
Yeah. Were you considering it, too?

17:17.470 --> 17:20.480
It's gonna be hard 
to keep it from her much longer.

17:20.900 --> 17:23.530
I'll wait for the right time and tell her.

17:24.030 --> 17:26.320
You just act like usual.

17:26.320 --> 17:28.820
Got it. I'll let you handle it.

17:29.720 --> 17:32.530
Okay, I'm going to bed.

17:33.650 --> 17:35.160
One last thing.

17:35.610 --> 17:36.510
What is it?

17:39.500 --> 17:42.020
Good night, Maehara.

17:44.930 --> 17:48.760
It feels strange actually
 saying it out loud.

17:50.280 --> 17:52.120
G-Good night.

18:01.270 --> 18:02.680
Want to sleep in my room?

18:02.680 --> 18:03.480
Huh?!

18:05.430 --> 18:08.770
So, here we are at my place.

18:19.730 --> 18:22.330
I... I'm back home.

18:23.470 --> 18:25.480
Welcome back, Umi.

18:26.000 --> 18:29.300
And good to see you, Maehara-kun.

18:29.300 --> 18:32.900
N-Nice to meet you. I'm Maehara Maki.

18:34.710 --> 18:36.580
What a polite young boy.

18:36.580 --> 18:38.670
I'm Asanagi Sora,

18:38.670 --> 18:42.180
and unfortunately, I'm the mother 
of that bad girl next to you.

18:45.270 --> 18:50.280
Listen, Umi. I'm not saying you're 
not allowed to have fun.

18:50.280 --> 18:55.900
But you need to keep us up to speed 
and not cause us any concern.

18:55.900 --> 18:56.950
Got that?

18:57.450 --> 18:59.980
Yes. I'm really sorry.

18:59.980 --> 19:02.600
I'll be more careful in the future.

19:02.600 --> 19:04.430
As will I.

19:04.430 --> 19:05.570
Good.

19:06.000 --> 19:07.970
Now, Maehara-kun...

19:07.970 --> 19:11.380
How did you and Umi get so close?

19:11.380 --> 19:12.010
Hey!

19:12.010 --> 19:17.540
I've asked Umi, but she just shuts me out, 
saying it's none of my business.

19:17.540 --> 19:19.100
Erm...

19:19.100 --> 19:21.780
Maehara! You don't have 
to tell her anything!

19:21.780 --> 19:24.410
See? Just like that.

19:24.410 --> 19:30.690
And all I want to know is how my daughter 
and her first boyfriend got together.

19:30.690 --> 19:34.080
Th-That wouldn't be any 
of your business either!

19:34.080 --> 19:38.030
And you, Maehara. Don't give 
this old bag the time of day.

19:39.700 --> 19:43.580
Forget her and have some peaches! 
They're nice and sweet!

19:44.110 --> 19:45.410
O-Okay.

19:45.410 --> 19:50.550
It's kind of you to peel them for him 
with those clumsy fingers of yours.

19:50.550 --> 19:51.540
No...

19:53.350 --> 19:54.380
Maehara-kun.

19:55.510 --> 19:58.530
Please continue to be friends with Umi.

19:58.530 --> 20:01.300
You know what she's like, 
but she's a good kid deep down.

20:04.060 --> 20:04.880
Of course.

20:07.430 --> 20:10.560
Oh, if you don't mind, 
why don't you have sleepovers here?

20:11.010 --> 20:14.720
That way, I can watch over you. 
It'd help me relax.

20:14.720 --> 20:17.320
A genius idea, if I do say so myself!

20:18.200 --> 20:22.140
Maehara, sew my mom's mouth shut! 
I give you permission!

20:22.140 --> 20:25.080
Eek! Help me, Maehara-kun!

20:25.080 --> 20:27.040
Umi's so scawwy!

20:27.040 --> 20:28.500
Argh!

20:28.500 --> 20:30.960
Shut up already!

20:32.610 --> 20:35.420
Now, as you all know,

20:35.420 --> 20:38.270
our school festival's 
coming up next month.

20:35.420 --> 20:41.640
SCHOOL FESTIVAL REPS
BOYS:
GIRLS:

20:38.270 --> 20:41.640
Let's go ahead and choose our 
class's reps for the event today.

20:43.390 --> 20:45.480
Any volunteers?

20:46.480 --> 20:48.690
I figured not.

20:50.020 --> 20:54.650
So I went ahead and set up a lottery!

20:54.770 --> 20:57.110
WINNER

20:57.110 --> 21:00.390
Sensei, I won.

21:00.390 --> 21:01.990
Oh, okay.

21:02.700 --> 21:06.790
So our boys' rep for the festival 
will be Maehara-kun.

21:06.780 --> 21:10.660
SCHOOL FESTIVAL REPS
BOYS:
GIRLS:

21:07.620 --> 21:11.500
I feel so bad for the girls! 
Talk about rotten luck.

21:10.660 --> 21:11.490
SCHOOL FESTIVAL REPS
BOYS: MAEHARA MAKI
GIRLS:

21:11.500 --> 21:13.840
Whoever wins has to babysit Maehara.

21:15.070 --> 21:17.680
Is he even gonna be able 
to speak up during the meetings?

21:18.430 --> 21:21.430
What a jerk, running his mouth 
'cause he has a thing for Yuu-chin.

21:23.010 --> 21:25.100
Please... Please no.

21:25.510 --> 21:29.030
Yep, saw it coming.

21:26.620 --> 21:28.380
All right! I struck out!

21:29.560 --> 21:31.790
Yay, struck out!

21:31.790 --> 21:33.360
Yes! Safe!

21:32.490 --> 21:35.020
But that doesn't make it suck any less.

21:36.260 --> 21:37.830
I didn't get it.

21:46.330 --> 21:48.470
Is something the matter, Amami-san?

21:48.470 --> 21:51.790
Yes. I'd like to give the class 
a piece of my mind.

21:54.710 --> 21:58.710
Do you all hate Maehara-kun or something?

